          "description": "Server configuration. Actions: status | set | warmup | backfill_embeddings.\n\nACTION GUIDE — when to use each:\n- status: Show current configuration, provider cells, auth mode, and database stats.\n- set: Update a setting. Requires 'key' and 'value'. Valid key: 'log_level' (str).\n- warmup: Pre-download local embedding model (~570 MB) / probe the embed cell.\n- backfill_embeddings: Embed active rows missing a vector; optional batch_size is bounded to 100.",
